<title>UK: Rank reorganisation votes delayed.</title>
<headline>Rank reorganisation votes delayed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two class meetings of The Rank Organisation Plc called to approve a major restructuring of the company have been postponed until 0930 BST on September 13 because today's meetings didn't have a quorum, the company said.</p>
<p>In a statement, Rank said all the resolutions connected with the reorganisation were approved with the requisite majority of ordinary and preference shareholders at meetings convened by the court.</p>
<p>In addition, all resolutions were approved at the extraordinary general meeting of the company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
